        "@value": "Direct from the UK! “Seven Drunken Nights” tells the story of The Dubliners, a career spanning 50 years and invokes the spirit of Ronnie Drew, Luke Kelly, Barney McKenna, John Sheahan, Ciaran Bourke and Jim McCann. Ultimate feel-good Irish show not to be missed!"
