        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DIRECT FROM THE UK!  The ultimate celebration of Frankie Valli &amp; The Four Seasons, recreating the iconic powerful falsetto with perfection. This performance will have you hooked from the very beginning with classics such as ‘Walk Like a Man’, ‘Sherry’, ‘Oh, What a Night’ and many more!"
