        "@value": "Motown’s biggest hits from Diana Ross and The Supremes, The soulful favourites such as Aretha Franklin and James Brown. The Tonettes, Cathy and Marlene, with Selena Evangeline and from Las Vegas Grady Harrell, this show delivers a powerful and soulful performance just the way it was back in the 60s."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventCancelled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
