        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "LEGENDS SHOW - Bringing the most outstanding performers live on stage. Accompanied by the Rockin' Royals Band, this show will feature the most incredible Tributes to Buddy Holly (Zachary Stevenson), Roy Orbison (Jesse Aron), Music of Motown (The Tonettes) and Elvis Presley (Pete Paquette)."
