        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Patsy Cline Show / SHERWOOD PARK, AB | paquetteproductions"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "When Amberley Beatty steps onto the stage, the spirit, and the very soul of one of the greatest singers in the history of pop and country music comes to life. To the stunning evening gown, complete with the bright red lipstick, she embodies the sultry sound of the legendary Patsy Cline."
